{{Quote|Clear the bridge. Escort the officers down to the hangar.|[[Poe Dameron]]|<ref name="Episode 8">{{Film|VIII}}</ref>}}
An '''officer''' in the armed forces was an individual who held military authority. Other types of military officers included commissioned officers, [[Warrant Officer|warrant officers]],<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> and [[non-commissioned officer]]s. Commissioned officers could be divided between [[junior officer]]s of lower [[Military rank|rank]], and [[senior officer]]s of a higher rank.

[[Republic Defense Coalition officer|RDC officers]] served in the [[Republic Defense Coalition]] in the days of the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="No Big Deal">{{InsiderCite|222|Tales from the Occlusion Zone: No Big Deal}}</ref> [[Republic officer]]s were command military personnel who served the [[Republic Military|armed forces]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] during the [[Clone Wars]], while [[Separatist officer]]s were command military personnel who served the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]] [[Confederacy military|armed forces]]. [[Imperial officer]]s were command military personnel of the [[Imperial Military]]. In the [[Chiss Ascendancy]], [[Chiss officer]]s served in the [[Ascendancy military]].<ref name="Chaos rising" />

All military organizations depended on officers to effectively function. Non-commissioned officers would work with line [[infantry]], while [[general]]s would create strategies and tactics.<ref name="Rise">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref>

